From 78975ee48a61ac0006b9ad7a1406a9e6c11ad12e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: legsmechanical <joshgaine@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 4 Jun 2026 18:19:04 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(corun): open preset-less no-hierarchy modules to a param
