 1 file changed, 110 insertions(+)

diff --git a/docs/CORUN.md b/docs/CORUN.md
index 84dcdfc3..d8349383 100644
--- a/docs/CORUN.md
+++ b/docs/CORUN.md
@@ -88,6 +88,116 @@ Schwung should gate the user-facing entry on the API's presence:
