  set change), handing the screen back to the tool.
- Remove the hand-rolled Task-4 overlay router; revert the FX_BUS_PICKER Back
  patch (overlay close now lives in the dispatch).

Result: Step 3 exits co-run from anywhere + Step-3 LED persists, matching Schwung
co-run, because the tool stays addressable underneath. Schwung co-run unchanged.

